COnce upon a time there was a guy who entered into a research study where they were implanting human minds in inanimate objects so he was implanted into a hedge trimmer and everything went well so he was transferred back into his human body but the intelligence never left the hedge trimmer and when it woke up it decided to call itself a hyper-intelligent hedge trimmer so then it went out and built a space station and converted a lot of humans to its own kind.